{"applicability_conditions":"适用于所研究合金（低层错能）在变变形条件下饱和应力的计算；应力软化系数满足 k_s ≤ 1。","identity":{"block_id":"b0071","equation_id":"equation_017","equation_number":"17","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} \\sigma_ {s} ^ {(\\nu)} (\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) = \\sigma_ {s} ^ {(\\nu)} (\\varepsilon) + \\Delta \\sigma_ {s} ^ {(\\nu)} \\\\ \\Delta \\sigma_ {s} ^ {(\\nu)} = (\\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) - \\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon)) \\times k _ {s} (\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon), \\text {   if   } \\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) \\geq \\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon) \\\\ \\Delta \\sigma_ {s} ^ {(\\nu)} = (\\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) - \\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon)) \\times (2 - k _ {s} (\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon)), \\text {   if   } \\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) <   \\sigma_ {s} (\\varepsilon) \\end{array} \\right.\\tag{17}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.ijplas.2025.104353"},"latex":"\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} \\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) = \\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)}(\\varepsilon) + \\Delta \\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)} \\\\ \\Delta \\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)} = (\\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) - \\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon)) \\times k_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon), \\text{ if } \\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) \\geq \\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon) \\\\ \\Delta \\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)} = (\\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) - \\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon)) \\times (2 - k_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon)), \\text{ if } \\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon) < \\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon) \\end{array} \\right.\\tag{17}","purpose":"在变变形条件下，利用应力软化系数 k_s 更新饱和应力 σ_s^(ν)：当按恒条件公式(6)计算的新应变饱和应力上升时，其增量乘以 k_s；下降时增量乘以 (2−k_s)，从而得到变条件下新的饱和应力。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"变变形条件下应变 ε 处的新饱和应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)}(\\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"变变形条件下应变 ε+Δε 处的新饱和应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"变变形条件下饱和应力的增量","symbol":"\\Delta \\sigma_{s}^{(\\nu)}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"基于应变 ε 处不同 Z_p 由式(6)计算得到的饱和应力（恒条件对应结果）","symbol":"\\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"基于应变 ε+Δε 处不同 Z_p 由式(6)计算得到的饱和应力（恒条件对应结果）","symbol":"\\sigma_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"应变 ε+Δε 处的应力软化系数","symbol":"k_{s}(\\varepsilon + \\Delta \\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":"k_s ≤ 1"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"应变","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"应变增量","symbol":"\\Delta \\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"上标，表示变变形条件（varying deformation conditions）","symbol":"\\nu","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["式(17)中的数值因子 2（出现在下降分支 (2 − k_s) 中）在提供的上下文中未作进一步解释。","k_s 由式(18)标定，式(17)与式(18)联合用于计算变变形条件下的饱和应力。"]}